  "a841dafa-1897-4a7f-8d03-203eb29fd4f5"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the fibered graph with total graph ",
 StyleBox["total", "TI"],
 " and projection ",
 StyleBox["proj", "TI"],
 ", an association or a function on the vertices of ",
 StyleBox["total", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"41dfb906-c950-4c86-8245-60f253c8a6d2"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
