  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "43f4d880-5f38-4f1b-879a-477d18d81a6a"],
 ", with its total graph computed."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"e49848f5-1fc2-4aaf-a9e0-03b887b8cfef"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A fibered graph is a graph ",
 StyleBox["E", "TI"],
 " with a map ",
 StyleBox["\[Pi]", "TI"],
 " on its vertices. The fiber over ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " is the induced subgraph on ",
 StyleBox["F(p) = \[Pi]\:207b\.b9(p)", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ec2dfbf0-1ef5-4871-a876-0fc13be406e9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The base ",
 StyleBox["B", "TI"],
 " is reconstructed, not given. Its vertices are the values of ",
 StyleBox["\[Pi]", "TI"],
 ", and ",
 StyleBox["p \[NotEqual] q", "TI"],
 " are adjacent when some edge of ",
 StyleBox["E", "TI"],
 " joins ",
 StyleBox["F(p)", "TI"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["F(q)", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"10e112b0-6ae1-42ca-b147-b5e944d6c417"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An edge inside a fiber is vertical and collapses under ",
 StyleBox["\[Pi]", "TI"],
 ". An edge between two fibers is transverse."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ac06ae96-875b-4587-8e31-33a2da441eef"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "No condition is imposed: fibers may have different sizes, and a vertex over \
",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " may have no neighbour over a neighbour of ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ". The predicates add the conditions:"
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"4667d0da-9765-481b-aa80-9fa20015d956"],

